# Server-only GitHub token used by the /api/github function. It is never sent to the browser.
# Create a fine-grained token with "Public repositories (read-only)" access and no extra permissions.
# In Vercel: Project Settings -> Environment Variables -> GITHUB_TOKEN
# Never prefix secrets with VITE_: Vite embeds every VITE_* variable in the public JS bundle.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
